\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/MockRevenueCatPaywallService\/customerInfoStream()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" yields it first. Streams","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fan out — each call returns an independent stream, and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/MockRevenueCatPaywallService\/send(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" delivers to every stream","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that is still open — so two stores sharing one mock, or a ","type":"text"},{"code":"ResilientPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" wrapper","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"plus the paywall plugin, all observe the same transitions. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/MockRevenueCatPaywallService\/finish()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ends the streams that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are open at the time. Set ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/MockRevenueCatPaywallService\/customerInfoError","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/MockRevenueCatPaywallService\/restoreError","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" to make the corresponding","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"call throw, e.g. to drive the plugin’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".refreshFailed"},{"type":"text","text":" path or a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ResilientPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fallback."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Deliberate differences from the real ","type":"text"},{"code":"RevenueCatPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", chosen so tests are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deterministic:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A stream buffers every value it has not delivered yet; the real stream keeps only the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"newest. A test that sends several snapshots before its consumer runs sees each one, in order.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A new stream always yields the current snapshot first; the real stream yields a first value","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only if RevenueCat has already delivered customer info in this process.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Compared with Swidux’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SimulatedPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" (an actor with a dev-paywall UI and simulated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"latency, better suited to vendor-free previews and development builds), this mock offers a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"synchronous "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/MockRevenueCatPaywallService\/send(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", arbitrary injected errors, "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/MockRevenueCatPaywallService\/finish()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and delivery of repeated"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identical snapshots — ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SimulatedPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" drops a change that equals the current state."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MockPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" in SwiduxPaywall differs again: its stream finishes immediately after the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"t